<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Many have no real joy ’cause they are barren.</l><l>That’s the subtle enemy to us today.</l><l>Go forth! Pray, “Oh Lord! In desperation we act!</l><l>Oh, Lord grow more! Bring many sons to You!” we pray, more and more!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Duplicate Your heart in me to care for others.</l><l>As I’m nourished, I can nourish others too.</l><l>Jesus! You need us to bear the fruit for the vine!</l><l>How we need You! Lord, grant the growth in life that they might remain!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>God in man, and man in God, a mutual mingling.</l><l>Grafted into Him, the vine, the rich supply.</l><l>Build us! Perfect us! A transformation so sweet!</l><l>Oh how glorious! The New Jerusalem, the bride, we will be!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
